      "@id": "urn:x3d-scivis:dataset:tensor-spherical",
      "@type": "scivis:Dataset",
      "title": "Tensor Loom · No population favorite",
      "scope": "Covariance/PCA geometry and a fitted Gaussian reference region for observations. This is not a confidence ellipsoid for the unknown mean, a prediction-region calibration, or a Gaussianity test. Gaussian probability labels are justified for the stated synthetic population law; fitted contours remain plug-in estimates.",
